## Open Questions

| Question | Status | Resolution |
|----------|--------|------------|
| StreamableHTTP supports concurrent sessions? | ✅ Resolved | Spike confirmed — session isolation per connection |
| x402-mcp mixed paid/free tools? | ✅ Resolved | `paidTool()` + `tool()` coexist on same server |
| Source field trust enforcement? | ✅ Resolved | Log transparently, parent review during distribution is the trust gate |
| Learner self-report source override? | ✅ Resolved | AllowanceAgent logs what caller provides. Claude orchestration is trusted intermediary. |
| Passphrase in HTTP mode? | ✅ Resolved | Server-side env var (`OWS_PASSPHRASE`). Never exposed to remote callers. |
| How does Maya's Claude connect to HTTP server? | ✅ Resolved | Claude custom connectors: parent adds MCP URL at claude.ai/settings/connectors → syncs to mobile/desktop automatically. Free plan gets 1 connector. |
| Can parent add MCP server from Claude mobile app directly? | ✅ Resolved | No. Must add via claude.ai website. Then syncs to mobile. Landing page guides through this. |
| Can schools bulk-onboard families? | ✅ Resolved | Team/Enterprise plans: admin adds connector once in Organization Settings. All members see it and individually connect with one tap. |
| How does Maya receive the invite code? | ✅ Resolved | `invite-member` returns joinMessage with serverUrl + code. Claude delivers via `message_compose`. |
| What if ALLOWANCE_AGENT_URL is not set? | ✅ Resolved | Invite response omits serverUrl and joinMessage. Code-only invite still works. |
| How do parents connect Fitbit without developer credentials? | ✅ Resolved | AllowMe LLC registers one Fitbit app. Parent taps one link → Fitbit consent screen → authorize → done. Server handles OAuth code exchange and token storage. |
| Where are Fitbit tokens stored? | ✅ Resolved | `data/fitbit-tokens.json`, AES-256-GCM encrypted with key derived from `OWS_PASSPHRASE`. Auto-refresh on expiry. |
| Can MoonPay swap USDC(Base) → PAXG(Ethereum) cross-chain? | 🔜 Spike needed (Sprint 2.5) | MoonPay Swaps.xyz supports cross-chain routes. Needs validation before convert-savings ships. |
